# First launch on an empty data directory (ui.md §1.2): no menu, slot 0
# starts the base world in its first level with the intro cutscene
# (progression.md §10.4); watch its start, skip the rest by holding a key,
# solve the level, return to the map, check the save, open the pause menu.
size 854x480
wait 20
shot 01-boot
wait 200
expect log first launch
expect log intro
expect state play baba/0level
expect state cutscene=intro
wait 300
shot 02-intro-flower
wait 100
expect sound intro_reveal_1f
expect sound intro_disappear_1
shot 02b-intro-reveal
hold enter 70
idle 300
expect log intro skipped
shot 03-level0
expect music baba
moves RRR
shot 04-level0-moved
moves ZZ
solve
idle 900
expect log win 0level
expect state play baba/106level (map)
expect sound winnery_fast
shot 05-map-after-win
expect save 0 baba 0level 3
expect save 0 baba_prize 106level 1
expect save 0 baba_prize total 1
expect save 0 baba Previous 0level
expect save 0 baba leveltree 106level
expect save global baba firsttime 1
expect save settings savegame world baba
key escape
idle
shot 06-pause-map
key escape
quit
